nce</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"maxdmg\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Est. Max Dmg</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2587</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"summon\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Summon</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not possible)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"convince\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Convince</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not possible)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"primarytype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Triangle of Terror<br/>Archdemons</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"spawntype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Spawn Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"isboss\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rank</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Boss</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illusionable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illusionable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pushable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pushable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pushobjects\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pushes</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Immunity Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"paraimmune\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Paralysable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">--<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\"></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Test Server-exclusive.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20091125135534&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zoralurk_5b494f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Zoralurk.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>I AM ZORALURK, THE DEMON WITH A THOUSAND FACES</li><li>BRING IT, COCKROACHES!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It is an Archdemon and also a member of the Triangle of Terror. You can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Blessed%20Wooden%20Stake\">Blessed Wooden Stake</a> on the summoned demon's corpses in order to get <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Dust\">Demon Dust</a>.<br/>\nAccording to <a href=\"#/wiki/Edowir\">Edowir</a> Zoralurk is a female.<br/>\nShe is known to be \"the demon with a thousand faces\" (But very little is known about this monster). Zoralurk has yet never been seen on any Server, but was summoned by customer support on Test Server 2007.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-slideshow wikia-gallery floatright\" data-crop=\"1\" data-hash=\"f620d73ce7f6ecd6dfe850adaf0da373\" data-seq-no=\"0\" id=\"w-slideshow-0\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-wrapper\" style=\"width: 300px\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-images-wrapper\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-prev-next\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-arrow-tiny\"></use></svg><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-arrow-tiny\"></use></svg></div><ul class=\"wikia-slideshow-images neutral\" style=\"height: 225px; width: 300px\"><li class=\"wikia-slideshow-first-image\"><img alt=\"Zoralurk has been summoned by the Customer Support member Iscen.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption='Zoralurk has been summoned by the Customer Support member &amp;lt;a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.tibia.com/community/?name=Iscen\"&amp;gt;Iscen&amp;lt;/a&amp;gt;.' height=\"224\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zoralurk1_3895d2.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px;\" width=\"300\"/><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Zoralurk has been summoned by the Customer Support member Iscen.</div></div></li><li><img alt=\"Botija Of Fenix tries to solo Zoralurk.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Botija Of Fenix tries to solo Zoralurk.\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zoralurk2_fc027c.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px;\" width=\"250\"/><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Botija Of Fenix tries to solo Zoralurk.</div></div></li><li><img alt=\"Zoralurk in full action.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Zoralurk in full action.\" height=\"215\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zoralurk9_269d98.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px;\" width=\"300\"/><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Zoralurk in full action.</div></div></li><li><img alt=\"Zoralurk makes an awesome combo of a poison and a energy storm.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Zoralurk makes an awesome combo of a poison and a energy storm.\" height=\"183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zoralurk4_2c1413.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px;\" width=\"300\"/><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Zoralurk makes an awesome combo of a poison and a energy storm.</div></div></li><li><img alt=\"Botija Of Fenix fails his attempt and dies.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Botija Of Fenix fails his attempt and dies.\" height=\"212\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Zoralurk5_77c834.jpg\" style=\"border: 0px;\" width=\"300\"/><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-overlay\"><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-image-caption\">Botija Of Fenix fails his attempt and dies.</div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wikia-slideshow-toolbar\"><div><span class=\"wikia-slideshow-toolbar-counter\" data-counter=\"$1/5\">1/5</span></div></div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-1276)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Summons</span> (1-2 Demons)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Missing Element\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"13\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Question_Mark_Icon_e8125e.png\" width=\"8\"/></span></span> Great Firebomb</span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Wrath%20of%20Nature\">Wrath of Nature</a></span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Rage%20of%20the%20Skies\">Rage of the Skies</a></span></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Shapeshifting\"><img alt=\"Shapeshifting\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellwand_Icon_f4c7a5.png\" width=\"12\"/></span></span></span> Self Transformation</span> (Changes appearance into <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon\">Demon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoth</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devil</a> and possibly more <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a>)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.4000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:40.0000%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 60.0000%); display:inline-block;\">40%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.1000\" title=\"Death\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Death <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Cursed Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Icon_Big_de8a